The phase field simulations presented in this thesis are based on research conducted during my external stay at the Foundry Institute from the RWTH-Aachen University. The simulation of the gas-atomized powder particle was conducted using MICRESS software (Version 6.303, ACCESS e.V., Aachen, Germany).
